Glossary audio episodes — TTS-rendered MP3 files, one per glossary slug.

This directory is populated exclusively by scripts/generate-glossary-audio.py.
The manifest at app/src/lib/seo/glossary-audio-manifest.json is the runtime
source of truth; the script writes the MP3 + the manifest row atomically so a
listed entry always resolves to a real file.

See strategy/glossary-audio-playbook.md for the operator runbook.
